%% never RetainSameLead: Selected attention refreshed & All findings -- Same-lead refresh retains selected attention.
%% never ResetLead: Different lead opened & Attention selected -- Lead change resets attention.
%% never ResetAuthorization: Signed out & Attention selected -- Authorization retirement resets attention.
%% never ResetDisposal: Panel disposed & Attention selected -- Disposal resets attention.
%% never LateSubjectBoundary: Late response ignored & Signed out & Current research shown -- Late reads never cross the subject boundary.
%% never FilteringNoRequest: Selector changed & Explicit read added -- Filtering adds no request.
%% never ZeroMatchGuidance: No matching findings & Research cleared -- Zero matches preserve recorded state and next_step.
